{"id":"vod_md_3701","vodId":"3701","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":".hack//黄昏的腕轮传说","name_cn":".hack//黄昏的腕轮传说","date":"2003-01-01","year":"2003","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230830-1/b4050d1013e3c2d8ce06ce8e137c282c.jpg"},"summary":"一晃眼，上一次的“黄昏事件”已经过去四年了，风平浪静许久的The World中再度发生了似曾相识的神秘事件。秀悟（皆川纯子 配音）想都没想就进入了游戏之中，而玲奈（中原麻衣 配音）亦尾随其后，一同和他们进入游戏的，还有米蕾尤（松冈由贵 配音）。不了解这个世界的规则的秀悟很快就吃了瘪，在他和玲奈的面前，竟然出现了罕见的强大怪物铠战将军，而秀悟更是因此game over，就在秀悟弥留之际，一个神秘少女出现在了他的眼前，用一个吻使得秀悟死而复生，复生后的秀悟成为了黄金腕轮的继承者。随着时间的推移，众人发现游戏中的世界似乎遭到了某种侵蚀和破坏，黑暗里，一个阴谋正在缓慢酝酿之中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-30 08:14:49","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/HgKeDkQR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/ho0jry63/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/jYxxqU37/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/BH1Mz7qZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/S0zGfjsP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/EWaGatxq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/G3xMDHeC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/XohnUYQL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/I4CAWVQk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/rax2G8Iv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/xnQ9girb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/GMQNPEUV/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:44:13.781Z"}